    "「从服务器删除」会同步清掉其他设备上的这些消息；仅清空本地只影响这台 Mac，服务器缓存不变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Delete from server\" also removes these messages on your other devices. Clearing locally affects only this Mac; the server cache stays as it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
