    "只切换 ntfyx 的界面文字，保存在本机、不参与 iCloud 同步；服务器发来的消息保持原文。主菜单和个别窗口标题要重启 ntfyx 才跟着换": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only ntfyx's own interface text changes. The choice is saved on this Mac and never synced; messages from your servers keep their original wording. The main menu and a few window titles only follow after ntfyx restarts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
