          }
        }
      }
    },
    "浏览历史时，滚动一停下就判定：某条消息的顶部越过窗口上沿四分之一行高，它连同上面的所有条目一起标为已读，并像点击卡片那样同步到服务器。只露头一角的不算，刚打开主题看到的那一屏也不算。窗口开着时新到的消息同样保持未读、横幅照常弹。已读条目仍留在列表里，不抽走、不跳位": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you browse the history, each time the scroll comes to rest a message whose top has passed the window's top edge by a quarter of its own height is marked read, together with every entry above it, and the change reaches the server just as it would if you clicked the card. A card that only pokes a corner into view does not count, and neither does the screen you get when you first open a topic. A message that arrives while the window is open stays unread and its banner still appears. Read entries stay in the list: nothing is pulled away, nothing jumps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
